### List Applications
GET http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/applications?status=APPROVED&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Application Detail
GET http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/applications/LN202510200001
Accept: application/json

### Export Applications
POST http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/applications/export
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2025-10-16",
  "endDate": "2025-10-20",
  "status": "审核中",
  "channel": "Google Ads"
}

### Dashboard Overview
GET http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Query Daily Stats
GET http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/reports/daily?startDate=2025-10-16&endDate=2025-10-20&channel=all&repeat=all
Accept: application/json

### Export Daily Stats
POST http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/reports/daily/export
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2025-10-16",
  "endDate": "2025-10-20",
  "channel": "all",
  "repeat": "all"
}

### Admin Login
POST http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "ops.lead",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Current Session
GET http://localhost:8002/admin/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer mock-admin-token

### List Pending Loans
